 約 **64,653.4 USDC**。本輪連續且已收線的 15 分鐘 K 收於 **64,653.6**，仍低於 MA20 **64,736.6**、MA60 **64,824.7**；1 小時收盤也低於 MA20 **64,752.0** 與 MA60 **64,692.1**。雖然價格從 **64,208.6** 反彈，15 分鐘 MACD 負柱收斂、5 分鐘 MACD 轉正，但這更像急跌後修復，尚未收復 64,707–64,825 的壓力帶。故空方的切入方式應是等反彈靠近壓力區掛空，而非把眼前反彈誤認為趨勢反轉。\n\n資金流的偏空證據有限但方向一致：近 24 小時主動賣額約 **1,569.2M USDC**，略高於買額 **1,549.9M**；Binance BTCUSDC 未平倉量 24 小時減少 **2.37%**、4 小時減少 **0.87%**。OI 下跌本身不能辨別多空，也不能直接當作淨流","time":"2026-11-17T16:01:57+08:00"}],"started_at":"2026-11-17T16:00:00+08:00","models":{"quick":{"provider":"openai","model":"gpt-6-luna","key":"OpenAI 槽位 5"},"deep":{"provider":"openai","model":"gpt-6-luna","key":"OpenAI 槽位 5"}},"done":5,"running_role":"bull","waiting":null,"resumed":false,"last_issue":null,"issues":[]},"paused":false,"host":{"label":"GCP","version":"1.0.107","heartbeat_at":"2026-11-17T16:01:57+08:00"},"frontend_revision":"b58163fd628a2fe6","role_activity":{"bear":{"at":"2026-11-17T16:01:57+08:00","elapsed_s":56.6,"source":"role"},"onchain":{"at":"2026-11-17T16:01:00+08:00","elapsed_s":51.2,"source":"role"},"sentiment":{"at":"2026-11-17T16:00:46+08:00","elapsed_s":37.1,"source":"role"},"news":{"at":"2026-11-17T16:00:45+08:00","elapsed_s":36.5,"source":"role"},"pm":{"at":"2026-11-17T15:03:33+08:00","elapsed_s":24.4,"source":"role"},"conservative":{"at":"2026-11-17T15:03:09+08:00","elapsed_s":46.0,"source":"role"},"aggressive":{"at":"2026-11-17T15:03:00+08:00","elapsed_s":37.5,"source":"role"},"neutral":{"at":"2026-11-17T15:02:57+08:00","elapsed_s":34.5,"source":"role"},"trader":{"at":"2026-11-17T15:02:23+08:00","elapsed_s":11.6,"source":"role"},"manager":{"at":"2026-11-17T15:02:11+08:00","elapsed_s":24.4,"source":"role"},"bull":{"at":"2026-11-17T15:01:41+08:00","elapsed_s":58.4,"source":"role"},"market":{"at":"2026-11-17T08:00:23+00:00","elapsed_s":15.4,"source":"request"},"test-manager":{"at":"2026-11-17T08:00:30+00:00","elapsed_s":25.8,"source":"request"},"up-down-manager":{"at":"2026-11-17T08:00:34+00:00","elapsed_s":21.4,"source":"request